<style>
  .panel-root {
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 360px;
  }

  .panel-content {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    padding-right: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    padding-left: 16px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: #6b5a00;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
  }

  .eyebrow:dark {
    color: #e8c35a;
  }

  .heading {
    color: #1c1d20;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .heading:dark {
    color: #f4f1ea;
  }

  .row {
    color: #3a3b40;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .row:dark {
    color: #d2d6de;
  }

  .rule {
    height: 2px;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #3aa8c4;
    margin-top: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .button {
    justify-content: flex-start;
    margin-left: 16px;
    margin-right: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
</style>
<Panel class="panel-root">
  <div class="panel-content">
    <div class="eyebrow">HOW TO COOK</div>
    <div class="heading">FOODIVERSE kitchen</div>
    <div id="guide-hands" class="row">IWER is on CONTROLLERS now. In the top IWER bar, switch input to Hands. Look DOWN at the cyan mixer table. Six glowing foods sit there. Webcam is not used.</div>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <div id="guide-recipe" class="row">Ember Spark: Cosmic Fruit + Star-Pepper. Needs HEAT.</div>
    <div id="guide-step-1" class="row">1. Look at the table around the cyan bowl. Pinch (or controller Trigger) the orange fruit and star pepper. Drop both in the bowl.</div>
    <div id="guide-step-2" class="row">2. Press Heat on the left panel, press H, or poke the orange knob.</div>
    <div id="guide-step-3" class="row">3. Stir to 45%: press S, or wave an OPEN hand over the bowl.</div>
    <div id="guide-step-4" class="row">4. Grab Ember Dragon. Release it on Ice Gate. Snap the cookie wafer onto Cookie Bridge.</div>
    <div id="guide-archive" class="row">Archive: Ember locked, Grove locked, Mint locked</div>
  </div>
  <Button id="guide-xr-button" class="button">
    <ButtonIcon>
      <RectangleGoggles></RectangleGoggles>
    </ButtonIcon>
    <ButtonLabel>Enter XR - show hands</ButtonLabel>
  </Button>
</Panel>
